  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土地資源保育與永續發展",
    "sub_ename": "LAND RESOURCE CONSERVATION AND SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT",
    "describe_ch": "「土地資源保育與永續發展」課程旨在培養學生對土地資源管理與永續發展的核心認識，探討國土規劃、土地利用、環境保護與社會經濟發展間的平衡。課程結合國際永續發展目標（SDGs）與台灣在地案例，深入分析農地保育、都市更新、災害管理、能源衝突等議題。透過專題討論、案例分析與非政府組織（NGO）專題演講，強化學生批判思維與實務應用能力，為未來從事土地資源管理、政策制定與永續規劃奠定基礎。",
    "describe_eh": "The course “Land Resource Conservation and Sustainable Development” aims to cultivate students’ core understanding of land resource management and sustainable development, exploring the balance between national land planning, land use, environmental protection, and socio-economic growth. Integrating the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) with local Taiwanese case studies, the course delves into issues such as farmland conservation, urban renewal, disaster management, and energy-related conflicts. Through thematic discussions, case analyses, and guest lectures by non-governmental organizations (NGOs), students will strengthen their critical thinking and practical skills, laying a solid foundation for future careers in land resource management, policy-making, and sustainable planning.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
